0 41 665 [
[(Looping with the [until] object)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 39 638 [
[(It is sometimes desirable to make a loop without an embedded)]
[(delay \050as in "06.more.counters.pd"\051 but rather to make the)]
[(entire loop take place in the context of a single incoming)]
[(message.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 35 574 [
[(The [until] object is provided to make this possible and has)]
[(two modes: It can either run automatically for a certain)]
[(number of times \050a "counting" loop\051 or it can run forever)]
[(until stopped through its right inlet \050a "conditional")]
[(loop\051.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 42 287 [
[(\050As of version 0.41, [until] silently interprets negative)]
[(numbers to be equivalent to zero and outputs nothing.\051)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 43 240 [
[(Conditional loops get started with a "bang" to [until]'s left)]
[(inlet. Make sure you stop the loop with a "bang" to until's)]
[(right inlet, otherwise it will try to run forever and Pd will)]
[(freeze!)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
